Name: uBlock filters
URL: https://github.com/uBlockOrigin/uAssets
Version: 2026-11-09
License: GPL-3.0
License File: //plainbrowser/adblock/lists/ublock/LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: no

Description: uBlock Origin's own filter list ("uBlock filters", https://ublockorigin.github.io/uAssets/filters/filters.txt), bundled unmodified as data and used by the built-in ad blocker when the user turns it on (Settings > Privacy and security > Use uBlock filters). Copyright the uBlock Origin and uAssets contributors. Kept in its own directory because, unlike the EasyList lists, it is under GPLv3 only.
